  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5604000016)\n\nJi Min witnesses her boyfriend's affair, whom she thought she'd marry. After breaking up with him, she drinks out of shock and betrayal. The next morning, she finds someone asleep next to her, who turns out to be her boss and her sister's friend, Kim Seo-Jun.\n\nShe tries to pass it off as a drunken incident, but\nSeo-Jun has no intention of missing this opportunity.\nWill Seo-Jun's affection be able to change Ji Min's hurt heart ?",
